<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Dayna Himot — Night Auditor Resume</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <style>
    :root{
      --ink:#111827;
      --muted:#4b5563;
      --rule:#e5e7eb;
    }
    *{ box-sizing:border-box; }
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Inter,Arial,sans-serif;
      color:var(--ink);
      background:#fff;
      line-height:1.25;
    }
    .page{
      max-width:900px;
      margin:28px auto;
      padding:28px;
      border:1px solid var(--rule);
      border-radius:14px;
    }
    header{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:flex-start;
      padding-bottom:14px;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    h1{
      margin:0;
      font-size:24px;
      letter-spacing:-0.02em;
    }
    .subtitle{
      margin-top:6px;
      font-size:13px;
      color:var(--muted);
    }
    .contact{
      text-align:right;
      font-size:12px;
      color:var(--muted);
      line-height:1.35;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }
    section{
      padding-top:14px;
      margin-top:14px;
      border-top:1px solid var(--rule);
    }
    section:first-of-type{
      border-top:none;
      margin-top:0;
      padding-top:0;
    }
    .label{
      font-size:11px;
      letter-spacing:0.12em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }
    .p{
      font-size:13px;
      margin:0;
    }
    .job{
      font-size:13px;
      margin:0;
    }
    .job strong{ font-weight:700; }
    .meta{
      font-size:12px;
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-top:4px;
    }
    .block{
      margin-top:8px;
      font-size:13px;
    }
    .grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.3fr 0.7fr;
      gap:18px;
    }

    @media print{
      .page{
        border:none;
        border-radius:0;
        margin:0;
        padding:0.5in;
        max-width:none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header>
      <div>
        <h1>Dayna Himot</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Night Auditor • Front Desk • Guest Services</div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact">
        St. Petersburg, FL<br />
        303-432-4805<br />
        info@gofercontent.com
      </div>
    </header>

    <section>
      <div class="label">Summary</div>
      <p class="p">
        Hospitality and operations professional with long-term experience in customer-facing roles that require accuracy,
        discretion, and calm decision-making. Comfortable working overnight shifts, handling guest needs independently,
        balancing reports, and maintaining a professional front desk presence.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <!-- LEFT -->
      <div>
        <section>
          <div class="label">Relevant Experience</div>

          <p class="job"><strong>Front-Facing Operations & Guest Support</strong></p>
          <div class="meta">Hospitality, events, and service environments</div>
          <p class="block">
            Provided late-hour and independent guest support in environments where clear communication,
            issue resolution, and professionalism were required. Handled guest questions and concerns,
            followed established procedures, and ensured smooth operations without escalation.
          </p>

          <p class="block">
            Regular responsibilities included accurate documentation, schedule adherence,
            end-of-day close-out tasks, and coordination with on-site teams.
          </p>

          <div class="meta" style="margin-top:10px;">
            Experience translates directly to overnight front desk coverage,
            check-ins and check-outs, and audit-shift responsibility.
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="label">Operations & Accountability</div>
          <p class="p">
            Trusted with responsibility during off-hours, including maintaining secure spaces,
            following cash and payment procedures, producing reports, and ensuring policies
            are followed consistently.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="label">Communication</div>
          <p class="p">
            Clear, professional communication with guests, coworkers, and management.
            Comfortable explaining policies, documenting issues, and escalating only when necessary.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT -->
      <div>
        <section>
          <div class="label">Availability</div>
          <p class="p">
            Overnight shifts<br />
            Weekends and holidays<br />
            Full-time or part-time
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="label">Skills</div>
          <p class="p">
            Guest service<br />
            Cash handling awareness<br />
            Report generation<br />
            Computer systems<br />
            Independent shift coverage<br />
            Calm issue resolution
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="label">Education</div>
          <p class="p">
            B.A., Social Documentary Journalism<br />
            Metropolitan State University of Denver
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="label">Additional</div>
          <p class="p">
            Detail-oriented<br />
            Reliable attendance<br />
            Comfortable working alone overnight
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
